{"id":"4e62b6beb4c1e82d","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md","title":"Ring of Integers","display":"df-ring-of-integers — Ring of Integers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ring-of-integers","aliases":["58-df-ring-of-integers","Ring of Integers"],"display":"df-ring-of-integers — Ring of Integers","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ring-of-integers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ring-of-integers</span><span>Ring of Integers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ring-of-integers — Ring of Integers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\">\\(K,\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:\\mathbb Z\\to K\">\\(\\iota:\\mathbb Z\\to K\\)</span> is an explicitly supplied unital ring embedding.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> is defined relative to this field presentation and embedding.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring\\text{-}of\\text{-}integers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S\n(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\mathbb Z,K)\n\\land\\iota(0)=0_K\n\\land\\iota(1)=1_K\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\iota(a+b)=\\iota(a)+_K\\iota(b)\n\\land\\iota(ab)=\\iota(a)\\cdot_K\\iota(b)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\iota(a)=\\iota(b)\\to a=b)\n\\land\n\\mathcal O=\n\\{x\\in K:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\n\\bigl(x^n+_K\\sum_{j&lt;n}\\iota(a(j))\\cdot_Kx^j=0_K\\bigr)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring\\text{-}of\\text{-}integers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S\n(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\mathbb Z,K)\n\\land\\iota(0)=0_K\n\\land\\iota(1)=1_K\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\iota(a+b)=\\iota(a)+_K\\iota(b)\n\\land\\iota(ab)=\\iota(a)\\cdot_K\\iota(b)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\iota(a)=\\iota(b)\\to a=b)\n\\land\n\\mathcal O=\n\\{x\\in K:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\n\\bigl(x^n+_K\\sum_{j&lt;n}\\iota(a(j))\\cdot_Kx^j=0_K\\bigr)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the integral closure of the displayed copy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota[\\mathbb Z]\">\\(\\iota[\\mathbb Z]\\)</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>; the coefficient tuple explicitly represents a monic polynomial, so no untyped polynomial or <code>Monic</code> predicate is needed.</li>\n<li>When the presented field is a finite extension of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span>, this set is the usual ring of integers of a number field.</li>\n<li>Being a Dedekind domain, having <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span>-rank <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[K:\\mathbb Q]\">\\([K:\\mathbb Q]\\)</span>, and the discriminant identities are theorems under the number-field hypothesis, not unconditional clauses of the definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Neukirch, Algebraic Number Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)$ is from [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,\\mathcal O,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota:\\mathbb Z\\to K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring\\text{-}of\\text{-}integers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S\n(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,\\mathbb Z,K)\n\\land\\iota(0)=0_K\n\\land\\iota(1)=1_K\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\iota(a+b)=\\iota(a)+_K\\iota(b)\n\\land\\iota(ab)=\\iota(a)\\cdot_K\\iota(b)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\iota(a)=\\iota(b)\\to a=b)\n\\land\n\\mathcal O=\n\\{x\\in K:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\n\\bigl(x^n+_K\\sum_{j<n}\\iota(a(j))\\cdot_Kx^j=0_K\\bigr)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota[\\mathbb Z]","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"[K:\\mathbb Q]","display":false}],"bytes":1837,"backlinks":[{"id":"cdb68267138bfe71","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)$ (see [[58-df-ring-of-integers]])"},{"id":"2a057f83805b06e9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_K;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)$ (see [[58-df-ring-of-integers]])"},{"id":"3befcba3ff8da9d2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8acc7c3954935c64","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingOfIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O;K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\iota)$（七元整数环谓词，见 [[../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ring-of-integers.md|58-df-ring-of-integers]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751"]}